br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>一</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>护理学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DhpRMH3wkWmHkGtyKZbmebIDHUfDmXzkxNVPFFvIfSOvltJtyQ77ESibMZicMZpb91E2q9dgqMjPcCb5eujviaCjkia1TQCVD3ZuiaGiaiabLpGC7I/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>创立时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><span>北京协和医学院创建于1917年，作为国家最高医学教育机构，是国家医学研究和教育事业先进的思想源和强劲的动力源。建校之初即确立了“在中国创办世界一流医学院”的办学目标，并于1920年建立了北京协和医学院护士学校。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/DhpRMH3wkWlJRaxHla0mdC5jibpDbG916TBicHrrNGS9PH0vf0n25T1mnVW1udE4b5qZnZQpibxnWBfysgf22aMp5WcCIB0vN8jLic5Y0ia7DyVU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DhpRMH3wkWkn7UNcQYjg5RywibZKDVicST9mSxqpOCCbOI3GGL1qM6ZGEvPQ84ibPgiaGicl8UtCc6KGUJJRibziafFBONTWm3OMBB1kLy2MNke198/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>培养理念</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><span>协和高等护理教育开办之日起，与临床医学八年制同步定位于“高进、优教、严出”的优质水准，坚持小规模的培养模式，采用最先进的办学理念，开创了我国高等护理教育的先河，成为我国培养高端护理人才的教育典范。建校百年来，协和护理教育恪守“勤、慎、警、护”的教育箴言，培养了一批又一批高层次护理人才，引领了中国护理教育实践、管理和研究的发展，成为培养我国现代护理人才的摇篮。目前协和护理学院已有9位毕业生获得“南丁格尔奖章”。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资力量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><span>北京协和医学院护理学院名师荟萃，学院现有博士生导师4名，硕士生导师10名，具有丰富的教学和科研经验。研究领域包括：成人护理、精神科护理、社区护理、老年护理、儿童保健、妇女保健、慢病管理、护理信息、护理管理和护理教育等。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>二</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>校园开放日简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活</span></strong><strong><span>动简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.活动时间：2026年7月初（具体时间另行通知）</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.活动地点：北京市石景山区八大处路33号</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.活动形式：线下举办，具体活动安排及日程以后续正式通知为准</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵守法律法规和学校的规章制度，诚实守信品行端正；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.全国985、211高校及双一流建设高校2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本科阶段学习成绩优异，预计能获得推免资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.具有护理学及相关专业背景，对护理科研工作有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的潜在研究能力和应用能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.英语水平良好，具备利用英语进行科研、写作以及交流的能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请时间</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起至</span><strong><span><span>2026年6月28日</span></span><span><span>23：59</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请材料</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.北京协和医学院护理学院2026年暑期校园开放日申请表（文末下载）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科历年成绩单证明材料，须盖所在大学教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本科专业总评成绩排名证明材料，须盖所在大学教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.全国大学英语六级（CET-6）考试成绩或相关英语成绩证明（TOEFL、IELTS、GRE成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.其他有关能力的证明材料（如发表论文、专利、各类获奖证书等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.个人简历电子版。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名者应保证提交的所有电子材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，请务必认真准确填写申请材料的所有内容，本次活动的所有申请材料将作保密处理，只用于校园开放日活动，如因信息提供有误，由此导致的相关损失和责任由报名者自行负责。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>提交方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请所需的所有材料电子版通过</span><span><strong><span>扫描方式</span></strong></span><span>处理，按照</span><span><strong><span>1-7的顺序生成一份电子文件（PDF格式）</span></strong></span><span>，文件名为“</span><span><strong><span>学校-专业-姓名-2026年暑期校园开放日申请材料</span></strong></span><span>”，于</span><span><strong><span>2026年</span></strong><strong><span>6月28日</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>23：59</span></strong><strong><span>前</span></strong></span><span>发送至邮箱：  </span></span><strong><span>hulixly_pumc@163.com</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>审核及录取</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请材料审核及筛选工作由北京协和医学院护理学院组织专门委员会负责。邀请名单将以邮件通知学生本人。届时未接到邀请通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>任何疑问请联系北京协和医学院护理学院研究中心教学科研办公室。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.地址：北京市石景山区八大处路33号；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.咨询电话：010-88771126/010-65105878</span></span><span><span>（咨询时间为工作日 9:00-16:00）</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.邮箱：hulixly_pumc@163.com</span></span></p></section></section></